            {
                "entry_id": "d59df319-8818-334c-88a4-2fe5fcd6ae0c",
                "word": "Speedo",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "817112c0-bb3b-4c1f-8487-1c7a0890ec95",
                        "entry_id": "d59df319-8818-334c-88a4-2fe5fcd6ae0c",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "Speedos"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "71d2b495-8cb3-3a63-a71b-d4833ea4af68",
                        "entry_id": "d59df319-8818-334c-88a4-2fe5fcd6ae0c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A tight-fitting swimsuit, especially commonly worn by competitive swimmers and divers. Usually implies a brief or bikini style swimsuit."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "US"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b7ef6c9d-b40d-493b-8bbb-f62b90b315b9",
                                "sense_id": "71d2b495-8cb3-3a63-a71b-d4833ea4af68",
                                "text": "I could tell that she was a serious swimmer, because every time I saw her at the pool she was wearing a Speedo of one design or another."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "883c8bab-788c-4b9f-b306-5c90df2abe18",
                                "sense_id": "71d2b495-8cb3-3a63-a71b-d4833ea4af68",
                                "text": "She's wearing Mom's teeny-weenie black Speedo bikini, the one Mom wears to show how fit and trim she is."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "57f27b85-f9a2-46c7-9727-983b93a83817",
                                "sense_id": "71d2b495-8cb3-3a63-a71b-d4833ea4af68",
                                "text": "These muscle-bound hard bodies are wearing Speedo Lycra bikinis which stick to a man's body like a woman's wet T-shirt."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4c0f2d6e-e10d-4f6d-9b94-792372f51b00",
                                "sense_id": "71d2b495-8cb3-3a63-a71b-d4833ea4af68",
                                "text": "There were dozens of girls in there - girls on the deck in bathing suits, most of them Speedos because they were racing."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b3dc8fe8-235b-4b7b-b6ba-82391cd99466",
                                "sense_id": "71d2b495-8cb3-3a63-a71b-d4833ea4af68",
                                "text": "Ryan and I remain unmoved, standing at the edge of the water as five Speedo-clad lifeguards rush up to us."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ba6d718a-2445-39ee-a9f6-09c4028d87a5",
                        "entry_id": "d59df319-8818-334c-88a4-2fe5fcd6ae0c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "(by restriction) A male swimsuit, very tight fitting and small, brief-style, and not a thong-type."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "US"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9a17e94e-8d71-4222-ad59-45e27df31438",
                                "sense_id": "ba6d718a-2445-39ee-a9f6-09c4028d87a5",
                                "text": "She called down from upstairs, \"He'll be out in a minute: he's just putting his Speedo on.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
